      "rationale": "'min bɛ ji bila kɔnɔbolo kan' — Heburu ka cɛkɛ-daɲɛ dɔgɔnen; bayɛlɛmabaga dɔw n'a dogoya ka kɛ 'cɛmɔgɔbɛɛ' ye (ASV\/JPS)"
